# Vulnerability details

When creating a lock the player can either call `lock` directly or `setLockDuration` directly.
When players lock directly without call `setLockDuration` first it sets the default `minLockDuration` as the players lock duration which is 30days, the player can extend this lock period by calling `setLockDuration` whenever. The `setLockDuration` can't decrease the previously set duration but can increase them, however it doesn't account for the new set duration going beyond the `maxLockDuration` of 90days.

## Impact
