Any reminder asset is saved in the players struct of `lockedToken.remainder` which will be added to the users new lock if they choose to lock again. However this process can be exploited. This occurs because the remainder from previous locks is not considered during the unlocking process, leading to financial loss.

## Impact
Players can steal Nfts by unlocking all the quantities locked and re-locking them to increase the remainder which gets added to the `remainder` increasing the amount of NFt the lock is really worth.

