Users attempting to lock tokens or send ETH after the lockdrop end time has passed will have their assets transferred to the contract without receiving the corresponding NFTs. This silent failure can lead to user confusion and dissatisfaction, as well as potential financial loss. Due to the fact that users can be using their asset for other things rather than just locking them away.

