```

After that, in _lock(), caculation of `reminder` will be skiped due to msg.sender is migrationManager.
This a problem that `lockedToken.reminder` wii be reset to zero, because in _lock(), Only when the caller is not the migrationManager will the reminder be calculated and assigned to `lockedToken.remainder`, otherwise, the initial reminder variable (which is 0) will simply be assigned to `lockedToken.reminder`.
