locked quantity         100     100             100             100
reminder                10      20                0              10        
added Munchables        3       6                 9              12

```
User has locked a total of 400 Ether, should add 400/30=13 Munchables not 12 instead.
Ultimately, users may lose the Munchables that originally belonged to them.


