The intended purpose is to prevent users from unlocking tokens before the specified unlock time. However, the check in `setLockDuration()` permits users to set a new duration that shortens the lock period, [setLockDuration()#256](https://github.com/code-423n4/2024-05-munchables/blob/57dff486c3cd905f21b330c2157fe23da2a4807d/src/managers/LockManager.sol#L256-L261):
